{"code":"N10","wikidata":"Q13021643","wikipedia":{"en":"Phahon Yothin 24 BTS station","th":"สถานีพหลโยธิน 24"},"summary":{"en":"Phahon Yothin 24 Station is a BTS Skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit Line in Bangkok, Thailand. The station was planned to open in 2020 when all stations on the northern extension was completed, but the Ministry of Transport requested the station to open in phase 2 (Ha Yaek Lat Phrao-Kasetsart University) in December 2019.","th":"สถานีพหลโยธิน 24 เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนพหลโยธิน ในพื้นที่เขตจตุจักร กรุงเทพมหานคร เปิดให้บริการตั้งแต่วันที่ 4 ธันวาคม พ.ศ."},"opened":"2019-12-04","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/BTS_Phahon_Yothin_24_-_Station_close_up.jpg/960px-BTS_Phahon_Yothin_24_-_Station_close_up.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Phahon_Yothin_24_-_Station_close_up.jpg","author":"Rachasak Ragkamnerd","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/BTS_N10_Phahonyothin_24_Station.jpg/960px-BTS_N10_Phahonyothin_24_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_N10_Phahonyothin_24_Station.jpg","author":"Wasin147","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/BTS_Phahon_Yothin_24_-_Entrance_escalator.jpg/960px-BTS_Phahon_Yothin_24_-_Entrance_escalator.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Phahon_Yothin_24_-_Entrance_escalator.jpg","author":"Rachasak Ragkamnerd","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/BTS_Phahon_Yothin_24_-_Exit_stairway.jpg/960px-BTS_Phahon_Yothin_24_-_Exit_stairway.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_ca